      "text": "15. Hands-on: See Your Memory",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "15. Hands-on: See Your Memory",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bGXZmD_nox_SqYLoPJBQw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 633.5637146898734,
      "y": 16000.274331063432,
      "width": 528,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1316718667,
      "version": 28,
      "versionNonce": 841339013,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788291451005,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "free -h\n\nYou'll see something similar to:\n               total        used        free\nMem:            16Gi        7.2Gi       1.5Gi\nSwap:            4Gi        0.0Gi       4Gi\n\nDon't worry about interpreting every column yet.\nFor now, just understand:\n\nfree -h\n\ngives you an overview of system memory and swap.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "free -h\n\nYou'll see something similar to:\n               total        used        free\nMem:            16Gi        7.2Gi       1.5Gi\nSwap:            4Gi        0.0Gi       4Gi\n\nDon't worry about interpreting every column yet.\nFor now, just understand:\n\nfree -h\n\ngives you an overview of system memory and swap.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hfrIZbH3D5ulGHcREjXG4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 598.5637146898734,
      "y": 16380.399331063432,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
